2026-09-09T15:30:25.7914881Z       "body": "When any dependency override is configured, request dependency resolution rebuilds every dependency graph, including dependencies whose callable has not changed. An unrelated override therefore adds signature analysis and recursive graph construction to every request.\n\nReuse the existing `Dependant` when the resolved callable is the original callable. Actual overrides still build their replacement graph, and recursive resolution still applies overrides to children of unchanged parents.\n\nRegression tests cover unrelated overrides, self-overrides, nested overrides beneath unchanged parents, query validation, and clearing overrides between requests. All three new test cases fail on the base revision and pass with this change.\n\nRelated to #8402.\n\nThis PR addresses unnecessary dependency graph reconstruction during dependency resolution when dependency overrides are configured. It does not address every performance optimization discussed in #5554.\n\nLocal benchmark (Windows, Python 3.12.14; in-process HTTPX ASGI requests; five batches of 100 requests after 20 warm-up requests; median milliseconds per request):\n\n| Dependency chain depth | Before, unrelated override | After, unrelated override | Before, no override | After, no override |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | 0.895 | 0.434 | 0.445 | 0.441 |\n| 10 | 6.999 | 0.601 | 0.598 | 0.594 |\n| 20 | 18.530 | 0.782 | 0.760 | 0.751 |\n\nThese synthetic measurements illustrate this specific case; they are not general application throughput claims.\n\nValidation:\n\n- New regression tests: 3 failed before, 3 passed after.\n- Related dependency, security, scope, and cache tests: 352 passed, 1 skipped.\n- Ruff lint and format checks passed for both changed files.\n- Mypy passed for all 48 FastAPI source files.\n- Ty passed for both changed files.\n- Extended `tests/` suite, excluding benchmark directories: 3330 passed, 13 skipped, 5 xfailed; one translation test initially failed because Git was absent. After adding portable Git to PATH, that test passed (1 passed). No test failures remain unresolved. The separate `scripts/tests/` suite and the CI platform/version matrix were not run.",
2026-09-09T15:30:25.7927574Z       "changed_files": 2,
2026-09-09T15:30:25.7928063Z       "closed_at": null,
2026-09-09T15:30:25.7928541Z       "comments": 1,
